msgctxt "s-99ba737af544-0027"
msgid "⟦SEP_0006⟧ [⟦CODE_0001⟧](⟦DEST_0002⟧) ⟦SEP_0007⟧ the regex captures ⟦CODE_0003⟧..⟦CODE_0004⟧, rebuilt each pass ⟦SEP_0008⟧ the same captures, as runs of ⟦CODE_0005⟧ ⟦SEP_0009⟧"
