msgctxt "s-1364e2043b5f-0028"
msgid "⟦SEP_0004⟧ [⟦CODE_0001⟧](⟦DEST_0002⟧) ⟦SEP_0005⟧ SQLite's trigger firing again ⟦SEP_0006⟧ table rows, and ⟦CODE_0003⟧ for the card number ⟦SEP_0007⟧"
